'Swapnajita Sankhua is an Odia poet whose work appears in the anthology In Our Own Voice: Poems by Odia Women Poets, published by Black Eagle Books in 2023. Translated by J. P. Das and edited by Vinita Gupta Chaturvedi, the volume places her among several generations of women writing in Odia.',
